      "name": "Hydration",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Azarketi must regularly submerge themselves in water to rehydrate their water-acclimated skin. After the first 24 hours outside of water, they gain a –1 status penalty to Fortitude saves as their skin cracks and their gills become painful. After 48 hours, they begin to suffocate until returned to water.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Swim Away",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The azarketi crab catcher is swimming</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The azarketi crab catcher is targeted with an attack and can see the attacker</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The azarketi crab catcher gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. After the attack, they Swim 5 feet.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
